Notes on choices: 8 experts, top_k=2 is the Mixtral-style sweet spot — 8 experts give good sparsity without diminishing routing utility, top_k=2 improves performance vs top_k=1 at modest compute cost. capacity_factor=1.25 balances load-balance loss against token-drop rate for a 1B-scale model on 2048-token sequences.